## Project Folder Structure

```text
frontend/src/app/
├── platform-admin/              Platform Admin tenant console
├── tenant-admin/                Tenant Admin members and assignments
├── admin/                       Compatibility redirect to /tenant-admin
├── documents/
│   ├── procedures/new/           Level 2 procedure form
│   ├── approvals/                CEO/MD approval workspace
│   ├── change-requests/          Document change workflow
│   └── periodic-reviews/         Periodic review workflow
├── forms/                        Level 4 templates and quality records
├── login/                        Tenant and Platform Admin login
└── page.tsx                     Main dashboard

backend/src/
├── auth/                         JWT login and authorization guards
├── documents/                    Documents, approvals, changes, and reviews
├── files/                        PDF/image upload and download
├── forms/                        Level 4 templates and quality records
├── tenant-admin/                Tenant member management API
├── prisma/                      Prisma service and database access
├── app.controller.ts            Backend health endpoint
└── app.module.ts                Root NestJS module

prisma/
└── schema.prisma                Shared root Prisma schema
```

The structure is organized around product domains. The CEO/MD approval experience is located under `frontend/src/app/documents/approvals/`, because approval is a document workflow rather than a separate organizational administration area.

